WEBVTT

00:12:58.899 --> 00:13:02.306
And that made me able to cope with change,

00:13:02.306 --> 00:13:06.634
indeed, eventually to welcome change,

00:13:06.634 --> 00:13:11.666
though I'm told I'm still very difficult.

00:13:11.666 --> 00:13:13.801
Thank you very much.

00:13:13.801 --> 00:13:21.081
(Applause)